%N A398411 Decimal expansion of Sum_{k>=1} (-1)^(k+1) * H(k) * H(k/2) / k^2, where H(k) = A001008(k)/A002805(k) is the k-th harmonic number, and H(x) is the harmonic number for the real value x.
%C A398411 See A074599 and A350670 for the value of H(x) at half integers.
%H A398411 Ali Shadhar Olaikhan, <a href="https://www.researchgate.net/publication/373488370">An Introduction to the Harmonic Series and Logarithmic Integrals</a>, 2nd ed., 2023, section 4.7.7, p. 352, eq. (4.155).
%H A398411 Wikipedia, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harmonic_number#Harmonic_numbers_for_real_and_complex_values">Harmonic number: Harmonic numbers for real and complex values</a>.
%H A398411 <a href="/index/Ha#harmonic">Index entries for sequences related to harmonic numbers</a>.
%F A398411 Equals 21*zeta(4)/4 - 35*log(2)*zeta(3)/8 + 5*log(2)^2*zeta(2)/4 - 5*log(2)^4/24 - 5*Li_4(1/2).
%e A398411 0.389342640040876977636268841810002109773240580283106...
